      "prov:value": "Owner directive, 2026-11-28: even in foreground discussion mode, any investigation or thinking exceeding ~15-20 s must not block the foreground turn; dispatch a background research or analysis agent immediately so the foreground stays open for user input, and report (a) what is being investigated, (b) expected duration (ETA), (c) potential outcomes and their implications, and (d) any structured clarification card up front, updating the user promptly on completion.",
